<title>UK: Sweden sets 300 mln Danish crown three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets 300 mln Danish crown three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Enskilda Debt Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DKK   COUPON     4.0 PCT   MATURITY    15.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  UNDISC    PAY DATE    20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    UNDISC    LISTING    COPENHAGEN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658  </p>
<p> NOTES	SYDBANK AS IS CO-LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
